                                                "sense_id": "aa928f5b-3c07-3c16-aedb-54f01d0834f9",
                                                "text": "Andrew Gudmund (from whom I am the seventh in descent) had an affair of the same kind. He also refused to have the child baptised[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84c4ae65-53a7-496b-9d69-7b10d7ef2b87",
                                                "sense_id": "aa928f5b-3c07-3c16-aedb-54f01d0834f9",
                                                "text": "When Martin's wife found out about his affair with her best friend, she asked for a divorce."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6df572fb-eea0-4dec-9e79-be08ebe5b342",
                                                "sense_id": "aa928f5b-3c07-3c16-aedb-54f01d0834f9",
                                                "text": "Mary had an affair with a woman from the gym."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b3fb464-d143-4a32-90e1-0b036590d18f",
                                                "sense_id": "aa928f5b-3c07-3c16-aedb-54f01d0834f9",
                                                "text": "\"Mean to say you been havin' an affair with Mrs. Peabody?\""
                                            },
